>
	<p>
		ThePickleballCourt.ca exists because buying pickleball gear online is noisy. Spec sheets contradict each other,
		“best of” lists blur into each other, and Canadian shoppers often need Amazon.ca availability — not a U.S.-only
		wishlist.
	</p>
	<h2>Our mission</h2>
	<p>
		We publish practical, original guides for everyone who plays: beginners buying a first paddle, intermediates
		chasing spin, seniors protecting their joints, and tournament players refining their setup.
	</p>
	<h2>How we research</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>We map products to real buying jobs (control, power, wide feet, portable courts).</li>
		<li>We only feature products that exist in our curated catalog with live Amazon.ca affiliate links.</li>
		<li>We prioritize clarity over hype — including when a cheaper option is the smarter buy.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Independence</h2>
	<p>
		Product links may earn us a commission through Amazon Associates. That never changes what we recommend or the
		price you pay. Read our
		<a href="/editorial-policy">editorial policy</a> and
		<a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a> for the full picture.
	</p>
	<p>
		Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.
	</p>
